1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:09,560
In this video we shall review how to perform bulk actions in the site tree.

2
00:00:09,560 --> 00:00:13,920
The bulk actions menu enables you to perform the following tasks across multiple sites

3
00:00:13,920 --> 00:00:15,720
or folders at once.

4
00:00:15,720 --> 00:00:21,240
Launching a scan of the selected sites, moving the selected sites to a different folder,

5
00:00:21,240 --> 00:00:24,240
or deleting the selected sites.

6
00:00:24,240 --> 00:00:28,680
The bulk actions menu is displayed when you use the checkboxes to select sites or folders

7
00:00:28,680 --> 00:00:31,320
on the site's page.

8
00:00:31,320 --> 00:00:38,260
First navigate to the site's page and select the relevant sites and you'll notice the bulk

9
00:00:38,260 --> 00:00:40,920
actions context menu appear.

10
00:00:40,920 --> 00:00:46,080
From here we can perform a scan against the selected sites, move to alternative folders,

11
00:00:46,080 --> 00:00:50,580
or delete the site altogether.

12
00:00:50,580 --> 00:00:55,620
Please note you will require the relevant permissions for bulk actions.

13
00:00:55,620 --> 00:00:59,260
These items will be available depending on your role and group.

14
00:00:59,260 --> 00:01:04,240
If you do not have permission to perform a particular action on any of the selected items, the action

15
00:01:04,240 --> 00:01:06,380
is greyed out.

16
00:01:06,380 --> 00:01:10,600
If you have permission to perform a particular action on some of the selected items, you can

17
00:01:10,600 --> 00:01:12,260
still select that action.

18
00:01:12,260 --> 00:01:18,260
The subsequent dialog displays a padlock icon next to the sites or folders that you do not

19
00:01:18,260 --> 00:01:20,540
have permission to edit.

20
00:01:20,540 --> 00:01:25,440
These items are skipped when the action runs.

21
00:01:25,440 --> 00:01:29,900
Selecting a folder selects all the sites and sub-directories of that folder.

22
00:01:29,900 --> 00:01:34,620
However, some folders may contain sites that are not visible due to your permissions, which

23
00:01:34,620 --> 00:01:38,340
may prevent you from performing the action on the folder.

24
00:01:38,340 --> 00:01:42,900
If this happens, you should deselect the folder and select all of the visible sites instead.

25
00:01:42,900 --> 00:01:43,900
Thank you.

